A capacitor $C$ of capacitance $47\ \mu\text{F}$ is connected across the output terminals of a bridge rectifier, as shown in Fig. 6.1.
{{figure:figure_6_1.png}}
The variation with time $t$ of the potential difference $V$ across the resistor $R$ is shown in Fig. 6.2.
{{figure:figure_6_2.png}}
Use data from Fig. 6.2 to determine the energy transfer from the capacitor $C$ to the resistor $R$ between time $t_{1}$ and time $t_{2}$.
